The Makefile does not compile the upstream C++ decoder. The pure-Go
st-go/googlepinyin builder filters src/data/rawdict_utf16_65105_freq.txt with
src/data/valid_utf16.txt and emits a bounded, architecture-independent gzip
dictionary. The runtime parser, segmentation, ranking, and process protocol are
separate Go code outside upstream.

Generated dictionaries and executables are not tracked in git. Distributions
of the helper (with or without a bundled dictionary) must include this notice
and LICENSE. For unbundled distributions, do not claim to license a separately
obtained dictionary; retain its supplier's notices.
